<title>FINLAND: FINNISH 2010 BOND YIELDS 6.87 PCT AT AUCTION.</title>
<headline>FINNISH 2010 BOND YIELDS 6.87 PCT AT AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/95</p>
<p>bond was announced by the State Treasury Office:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     15-10-2010</p>
<p> COUPON:				 8.25 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			6.87 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  112.15</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 228 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 483 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>NOTES: The previous auction of the bond raised 357 million</p>
<p>markka at a price of 104.70 and a yield of 7.69 percent. After</p>
<p>today's auction, the outstanding amount is 3,193 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
</text>
